[metadata]
Name=Dominic - Oloro
Description=Esper turtle. Never attacks. Propaganda/Ghostly Prison tax the swings, Teferi's Protection and Flare of Fortitude freeze the life total, Solitary Confinement and Energy Field + Rest in Peace shut damage off for good, then a huge draw engine digs to Approach of the Second Sun, Felidar Sovereign, Test of Endurance or Triskaidekaphile. 3 Game Changers (Teferi's Protection, Rhystic Study, Necropotence), so bracket 3.

